## 13. Linker Script

### 13.1 Memory Regions (`STM32F407VGTX_FLASH.ld`)

```
MEMORY
{
  RAM    (xrw)  : ORIGIN = 0x20000000, LENGTH = 128K     /* SRAM1 + SRAM2 */
  FLASH  (rx)   : ORIGIN = 0x08000000, LENGTH = 1024K    /* 1 MB Flash */
}
```

### 13.2 Key Sections

| Section | Location | Contents |
|---|---|---|
| `.isr_vector` | Flash (start) | Vector table (SP, Reset handler, IRQ handlers) |
| `.text` | Flash | Executable code |
| `.rodata` | Flash | Read-only data (const strings, lookup tables) |
| `.data` | Flash → RAM | Initialized global/static variables (copied to RAM at startup) |
| `.bss` | RAM | Uninitialized globals (zeroed at startup) |
| `._user_heap_stack` | RAM (end) | Heap and stack space |

```
Flash Layout:
┌────────────────┐ 0x0800_0000
│  .isr_vector   │ Vector table
├────────────────┤
│  .text         │ Code
├────────────────┤
│  .rodata       │ Constants
├────────────────┤
│  .data (init)  │ Initial values for .data (copied to RAM)
└────────────────┘

RAM Layout:
┌────────────────┐ 0x2000_0000
│  .data         │ Initialized globals (copied from Flash)
├────────────────┤
│  .bss          │ Uninitialized globals (zeroed)
├─── ── ── ── ──┤
│  Heap ↓        │ FreeRTOS heap (15 KB) + standard heap
│                │
│  Stack ↑       │ Main stack + task stacks
└────────────────┘ 0x2001_FFFF
```

